/ PDP-8 WORKBOOK
/ CHAPTER 7
/ EXERCISE 1
/ PAL8 ASSEMBLY
/ JEREMY PASTIN
/ VERSION 1.0 JULY 2, 2026
/
        FIELD 0
        *0200
/
/ GOAL: UNDERSTAND THE BN FILE FORMAT

	CLA CLL		
	MQL		/CLEAR AC, L, MQ
TOP,	IAC		/INCREMENT AC
	SZL		/INCREMENT MQ IF AC OVERLOADS
	JMP	MQINC
	JMP	TOP
	
MQINC,	CLA CLL		/AC & L ARE ALL 1S AT THIS POINT
	MQA		/PULL MQ INTO EMPTY AC
	IAC		
	SZL
	JMP	OS8RET	/RETURN TO OS/8 IF MQ OVERLOADS
	MQL		/PUSH BACK INTO MQ, CLEAR AC
	JMP	TOP	/START INCREMENTING AC AGAIN
	
OS8RET,	CIF CDF 0
	JMP I	(7600)	/RETURN TO OS/8
$